    "text": "## sub_549470_00549470 — Compute OBB and bounding sphere from scene mesh data\n\n**Summary:** Three-pass computation of oriented bounding box (OBB) and bounding sphere from vertex data in scene graph. First pass accumulates covariance matrix from all vertices and calls QRDecomposition to derive orientation axes. Second pass transforms vertices through resulting rotation matrix via D3D device wrapper and computes axis-aligned bounding box in local frame. Third pass computes farthest vertex distance for bounding sphere radius. Final loop builds 8 OBB corner points with axes and half-extents. Stores results in `this` offsets 0x18 (sphere radius), 0x1C-0x70 (OBB corners via D3D transforms), 0x7C-0x84 (center), 0x8C-0xE8 (OBB axes/half-extents). Called during audio engine initialization for spatial audio geometry.\n\n**Frame-path:** NOT_FOUND  \n**Call frequency:** UNKNOWN (no static path from tick root)\n\n**Called by:** AudioEngineInitialization (00546010)\n\n**Struct fields accessed:**\n\n| Base | Offset | R/W | Init (literal → value) | Purpose |\n|------|--------|-----|------------------------|---------|\n| *(*(this+0xEC)+0x204) | 0x10 | R | — | Next pointer in linked list of mesh entries |\n| *(*(this+0xEC)+0x204) | 0x20 | R | — | unknown |\n| *(*(this+0xEC)+0x204) | 0x118 | R | — | Count of vertex sub-buffers in mesh entry |\n| *(*(this+0xEC)+0x204) | 0x11C | R | — | Pointer to vertex sub-buffer array |\n| *(*(this+0xEC)+0x204) | 0x128 | R | — | Vertex count per sub-buffer (guard: > 0) |\n| *(*(this+0xEC)+0x204) | 0x12C | R | — | Offset to vertex data within sub-buffer |\n| *(*(this+0xEC)+0x4C) | 0x4C | R | — | Sibling/next pointer in scene graph tree traversal |\n| *(this+0xEC) | 0x3C | R | — | Flags byte; bit 0x10 controls D3D coordinate-space transform |\n| *(this+0xEC) | 0x4C | R | — | Next sibling pointer in scene graph tree walk |\n| *(this+0xEC) | 0x204 | R | — | Head of linked list of mesh geometry entries |\n| this | 0x18 | RW | — | Bounding sphere radius computed from farthest vertex distance |\n| this | 0x7C | R | — | OBB center X coordinate (pre-existing, used for distance computation) |\n| this | 0x80 | R | — | OBB center Y coordinate |\n| this | 0x84 | R | — | OBB center Z coordinate |\n| this | 0x8C | RW | — | Start of OBB output data (axes and half-extents array) |\n| this | 0x90 | RW | — | Continuation of OBB output data |\n| this | 0xEC | R | — | Pointer to scene graph root node for traversal |\n\n**Written-by note (persistence):**\n- this 0x18: written once per call (bounding sphere radius); overwritten each call\n- this 0x8C: written each call as start of OBB orientation output data\n- this 0x90: written each call as part of OBB output data\n\n**Globals referenced:**\n\n| Address | Name | R/W | Role |\n|---------|------|-----|------|\n| 0059e420 | dbl_59E420 | R | BaseDoubleConstant [DERIVED] (also: ` (BaseDoubleConstant = 1.0) |\n| 0059e880 | dbl_59E880 | R | HalfStep [DERIVED] (also: ` — lower threshold constant) |\n| 008b8f24 | dword_8B8F24 | R | D3DDeviceWrapperPtr [DERIVED] (also: ` — D3D device wrapper / scene manager singleton vtable (docs/22) |\n\n**Functions called:**\n\n| Address | Name | Purpose |\n|---------|------|---------|\n| 0053b6f0 | QRDecomposition | Factor covariance matrix into rotation matrix for OBB orientation axes |\n\n**Guard conditions (deterministic — field vs literal):**\n\n| Base | Offset | Test | Value | Field / meaning |\n|------|--------|------|-------|-----------------|\n| *(*(this+0xEC)+0x204) | 0x128 | > | 0 | Vertex count per sub-buffer must be positive for processing |\n\n**Guard interpretation:** Three tree walks each gated by `this[0xEC]` (scene graph root) being non-null — null BLOCKS all computation. Inner loop guarded by `i[70] > 0` (mesh entry must have sub-buffers). Per sub-buffer guard: count at offset 0x128 > 0 PASSES vertex processing; count <= 0 skips that sub-buffer. Bit flag check `(byte at node+0x3C) & 0x10` controls optional D3D coordinate-s